{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>銅鑼灣有連鎖電器舖懷疑被盜竊，損失約188萬元貨物。</p><p></p><p>事發在時代廣場一間店鋪，警方晚上近七時接獲店鋪負責人報案，指有61部相機及55個相機鏡頭懷疑被盜去，總值約188萬元，案件暫時列作盜竊案。警方正追捕一名年約40歲男子。</p><p></p><p>據了解涉事店鋪是豐澤電器，男子是店鋪職員。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T16:40:46.324747+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T15:20:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T16:54:09.487832+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T16:33:58.155023+00:00","content_hash":"15207597192650a9b13062c5d9dd599e1b5945b56baf5fa81c298a4b9aca8500","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T16:40:46.324747+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}